d /etc/rapid 0750 root rapid -
# /run/rapid-apply is deliberately NOT here: tmpfiles.d is only applied at boot
# and by the dpkg trigger, neither ordered against a service restart, so a
# missing directory made rapid-setup fail with 226/NAMESPACE. The four services
# that use the queue declare RuntimeDirectory=rapid-apply (Group=rapid, 0770),
# so systemd creates it before their mount namespaces.
